WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.600
Saturday’s forecast:

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.750
Scattered excuses, heavy procrastination,

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.550
and a high-pressure system moving in from The Commish.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.400
That pressure is expected to increase until you answer.

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:12.900
Open the yellow chip.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.000
Choose your name.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:14.950
Tap In,

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:15.600
Maybe,

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:16.500
or Out.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:17.800
Look at that.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.400
Conditions improving.

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:22.530
It’s TLPT RSVP.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.250
Give The Commish a break.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.050
He’s trying to run a poker game,

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:27.400
not predict the future.
